  "body": "The Victor stands out as Browns Bay’s premier apartment complex for modern build quality, expansive floorplans, smart security, underground parking, and direct town-centre positioning.\r\n\r\nThe Victor holds the clear advantage over other apartments. The superior coastal engineering combines a solid concrete-and-steel structure with marine-grade Nu Wall aluminium cladding and sliding solar gratings engineered to withstand Browns Bay’s salt air without heavy exterior maintenance.\r\n\r\nIt boasts unmatched space and architectural volume with 2.7m ceilings and a hanging garden open atrium with bridges that encapsulates the sunlight and fresh air for all to enjoy. Entertain on your private balcony or hold larger celebrations on the first-floor function area all year. The Victor exclusive community will make you feel at home.\r\n\r\nThe Victor residents benefit from next-generation security with Schlage Omnia eGO Bluetooth smart locks (offering app-based entry logs and temporary guest codes). There are 78 weather-protected underground basement carparks and a dedicated bicycle store.\r\n\r\nThat’s the difference in living at The Victor - whether you’re looking for low maintenance living, convenient beach location or a retirement alternative!",
